Cancel_Rounds_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the Safe
│   └── it should revert with OnlyBoard
├── when any investor has paid
│   └── it should revert with PaymentsStarted
├── when safe notes were converted into the round
│   └── it should revert with PaymentsStarted
└── when nobody has paid
    ├── it should mark the round cancelled
    └── it should emit RoundCancelled
